# GTKTerm Automation Script Example
# Test modem AT commands

# Send AT command to check if modem is alive
log Testing modem connection...
send AT\r\n
expect OK
delay 500

# Get manufacturer info
log Getting manufacturer information...
send AT+CGMI\r\n
expect OK
delay 500

# Get model identification
log Getting model...
send AT+CGMM\r\n
expect OK
delay 500

# Check signal quality
log Checking signal quality...
send AT+CSQ\r\n
expect \+CSQ: (\d+),(\d+)
delay 500

# Get IMEI number
log Getting IMEI...
send AT+CGSN\r\n
expect \d{15}
delay 500

log Modem test completed successfully!
